                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-29" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="540" y="570" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-30" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillWeight=4;hachureGap=8;hachureAngle=45;fillStyle=hachure;opacity=70;strokeColor=#23445d;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fillColor=#bac8d3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="330" y="710" width="90" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-31" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="360" y="670" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-32" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" edge="1" parent="1" source="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-33">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <mxPoint x="500" y="735" as="targetPoint"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-33" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillWeight=4;hachureGap=8;hachureAngle=45;fillStyle=hachure;opacity=70;strokeColor=#ae4132;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fad9d5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="385" y="710" width="35" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-34" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;看到这里的时候我产生了一个疑问：A对象不是黑色吗？代表的不是A所有的子引用都被扫描到了吗？但是这里的C还是白色的啊&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;这里涉及到一个重要的概念：那就是黑色代表的含义是什么呢？&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- 这里是只包括直接引用，而不包括更深层次的引用(也即该对象自己被访问了，且它的所有直接引用(也即该对象的字段所指向的对象)都已经被发现并加入到了标记队列中 )&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="710" y="410" width="980" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-35" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;这里又引入了一个新的概念：标记队列&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;strokeColor=default;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1350" y="330" width="340" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-36" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.75;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.28;entryY=1.058;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" edge="1" parent="1" source="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-34" target="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-35">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-37" value="" style="shape=curlyBracket;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;labelPosition=left;verticalLabelPosition=middle;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;sketch=1;fillWeight=4;hachureGap=8;hachureAngle=45;jiggle=2;fillStyle=hachure;curveFitting=1;opacity=70;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#1ba1e2;rotation=-181;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="605" y="625" width="20" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-38" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;当应用线程执行如下操作时就会出现漏标问题,也就是C对象漏标,会被错误的回收掉，这样再次访问A.C的时候,就会触发异常，因为无法访问一个不存在的对象&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;1.A.field = C ：黑色对象新增加了一个白色引用(增加)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;2.B.field = null：灰色对象删除了对于的白色引用(删除)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;而在上面才强调过黑色对象的意义：黑色对象代表着当前对象的所有直接引用都已经被扫描过了，但是这里的A还有C这个直接引用还没有扫描到，但是A却是黑色的，导致C会被回收，最终程序崩溃&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;strokeColor=default;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="640" y="625" width="1110" height="100" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-39" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillWeight=4;hachureGap=8;hachureAngle=45;fillStyle=hachure;opacity=70;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="330" y="830" width="90" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-40" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="370" y="790" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-41" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" edge="1" parent="1" source="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-42" target="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-43">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-42" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillWeight=4;hachureGap=8;hachureAngle=45;fillStyle=hachure;opacity=70;strokeColor=#ae4132;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fad9d5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="385" y="830" width="35" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-43" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillWeight=4;hachureGap=8;hachureAngle=45;fillStyle=hachure;opacity=70;strokeColor=#23445d;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="500" y="830" width="90" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-44" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="540" y="790" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-45" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" edge="1" parent="1" source="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-46" target="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-43">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-46" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillWeight=4;hachureGap=8;hachureAngle=45;fillStyle=hachure;opacity=70;strokeColor=#23445d;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fillColor=#bac8d3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="330" y="930" width="90" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-47" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="360" y="890" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-48" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillWeight=4;hachureGap=8;hachureAngle=45;fillStyle=hachure;opacity=70;strokeColor=#ae4132;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fad9d5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="385" y="930" width="35" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-49" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;NULL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;strokeColor=default;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="500" y="720" width="40" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-50" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;上面说的两个条件是必要条件，少一个都不会触发漏标的场景，如左边两个案例：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;1. 第二点不满足,没有删除灰色对象到白色对象的引用，那么C不会被回收，因为B还引用着C呢&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Menlo, Monaco, Courier New, monospace&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;2. 第一点不满足,没有新增加黑色对象到白色对象的引用，那么B和C都会被回收，因为B没有被GC Root引用&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;strokeColor=default;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="640" y="972.48" width="1110" height="100" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="QI2BOtYcePDBQrvWRp4a-51" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillWeight=4;hachureGap=8;hachureAngle=45;fillStyle=hachure;opacity=70;strokeColor=default;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fillColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
